  "description": "Declarative transactions for AutoRegisterDependency. Mark a class or method with [Transactional] and get Spring-style propagation (Required, RequiresNew, Supports, Mandatory, Never, NotSupported, Suppress, Nested), savepoints, rollback-only tracking and RollbackFor/NoRollbackFor policies. Capabilities are declared by an ITransactionResource adapter; unsupported ones fail loudly instead of pretending. No own third-party dependencies and no ORM adapters.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "AutoRegisterDependency.Extension.Transactional",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T06:42:25.48Z",
